# 启动：uv run uvicorn main:app --reload --port 9000

GET http://127.0.0.1:9000/
Accept: application/json

###

# 把 <token> 换成登录接口返回的 tokenValue
POST http://127.0.0.1:9000/chat
Content-Type: application/json
satoken: <token>

{
  "message": "我是谁？能看到哪些订单？"
}

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:9000/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
satoken: <token>

{
  "message": "帮我看看第一页订单有哪些"
}

###
